        "blend": "screen",
        "clip": { "type": "polygon", "points": [[556, 32], [768, 32], [768, 372], [612, 372]] },
        "label": "lid up. A screen-blended wash lifts the plate past the generation cut, so the leak is a hole burned in the toner rather than paint laid on it. Hard on the clipped diagonal, mottled everywhere else",
        "children": [
          {
